        <h1>What Is the Real ROI of AI <em>for a Small Business?</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A plain-English measurement guide for small and medium businesses. Why "time saved" is not a return on its own, how to calculate the ROI of an AI tool, what payback to realistically expect, and a 90-day rule for keeping or cancelling any tool.</p>
